The '''Krondor Necromancer Summon''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns while fighting the {{MobSprite|Krondor Necromancer}} in the {{Zone|Mage Outpost}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Krondor Necromancer Summon''' spawns while fighting the {{MobSprite|Krondor Necromancer}} in the {{Zone|Mage Outpost}}.

== Drops ==
{{Mob Drops Table
|level = 222
|orbs = 244
|coins = 74
|combat_xp = 333
}}

Killing a '''Krondor Necromancer Summon''' when the player is in the [[Barbarian Faction]] will reward them with {{Reputation|Barbarian|25}}. If the player is in the [[Mage Faction]] and they kill a '''Krondor Necromancer Summon''', they will lose {{Reputation|Mage|25}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Krondor Necromancer Summons''' quickly run towards and attack nearby players.

